					</div>
					<div class="comment-text">
						<span style="white-space:pre-line;">Less than 10% CPU multi-core performance isn&#39;t impressive.  Programmers might as well not upgrade to the M5 Pro MBP.  Just skip it and go for the M6 Pro MBP or find an M4 Pro MBP in the refurbished market in good condition.</span>
