						<span class="text-gray">March 3, 2026 at 08:28 PM</span>
						
						
					</div>
					<div class="comment-text">
						<span style="white-space:pre-line;">Given how amazing the M4 Pro (14-core) is, no need to upgrade to the M5 Pro (18-core).  Save some money.  

If you can and want to upgrade, wait until the M6 Pro comes out in October/November 2026.  If you cannot wait to upgrade, get the M5 Pro (18-core) and trade it in for the M6 Pro when it gets released.</span>
